## 4. Findings

- Blocking: none.
- F201 [Nit]: two clicks in one React batch send two start requests; both bodies hold the same lifetime. The server restarts the class with the same choice. Default: no change.
- F202 [Nit]: the panel posts until_17 after 17:00 Bangkok when no render happens between the clock change and the click; the server refuses the value with 400 invalid_input. The panel polls every 10 s, so the window is short. Default: no change; this extends the Review A finding F171.

No test stays red on purpose: the round found no Blocker and no Major.

